title: "genefamily-workflow: reproducible gene-family analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A small Python pipeline that runs profile-HMM discovery, multiple sequence
  alignment, maximum-likelihood phylogeny, domain/structure summarisation and
  expression figures on a fully synthetic dataset.
